.command-box {
  display: grid;
  gap: 0.6rem;
  width: min(36rem, 100%);
  font: inherit;
  color: var(--ink);
}

.command-box__form {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
}

.command-box__input {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  font: inherit;
  font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.92rem + 0.4vw, 1.25rem);
  color: var(--ink);
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid var(--muted);
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 0.6em 1.1em;
}

.command-box__input::placeholder {
  color: var(--muted);
}

.command-box__input:focus-visible {
  border-color: var(--cresyl);
}

.command-box__submit {
  font: inherit;
  font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 0.85rem + 0.3vw, 1.05rem);
  color: var(--slide);
  background: var(--myelin);
  border: 1px solid var(--myelin);
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 0.6em 1.2em;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.command-box__reply-slot {
  min-height: 0;
}

.command-box__reply {
  font: inherit;
  font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 0.85rem + 0.3vw, 1.05rem);
  color: var(--ink);
  border: 1px solid;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 0.6em 1em;
}

.command-box__reply--normal {
  background: var(--myelin-wash);
  border-color: var(--myelin);
}

.command-box__reply--error {
  background: var(--cresyl-wash);
  border-color: var(--cresyl);
}

.sr-only {
  position: absolute;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  padding: 0;
  margin: -1px;
  overflow: hidden;
  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
  white-space: nowrap;
  border: 0;
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
  :root:not([data-motion="reduce"]) .command-box__input {
    transition: border-color 150ms ease;
  }
}

:root[data-motion="reduce"] .command-box__input,
:root[data-motion="reduce"] .command-box__submit {
  transition: none;
}
```

The `--myelin-wash` and `--cresyl-wash` fills sit behind `--ink` text, so run `check_contrast` on those pairs in both themes and with each accent before you ship.

